[Excerpt: Lead Footprint]
|name=Farmhouse
The '''Farmhouse''' is the player's permanent residence in Stardew Valley. Initially, it has only one small room that contains a single bed, a fireplace, an old TV (either a [[Budget TV]] or [[Floor TV]]), various [[Furniture|decorations]] depending on what farm style was chosen, and a [[Furniture#Rugs|floor mat]] of varying design, which can all be changed and expanded later on. The outer footprint of the farmhouse is a 9&times;5 rectangle. The inner footprint of the farmhouse without upgrades is a 10&times;7 rectangle. The fireplace can be moved by left-clicking or turned on by right-clicking on it.

[Excerpt: Upgrades section]
