The '''Secret Woods''' is an outdoor area that can be entered from the northwest corner of [[Cindersap Forest]]. The entrance is initially blocked by a [[Large Log|large log]] that can be cleared after upgrading to at least a [[Axes|Steel Axe]].  

The Secret Woods contain seasonal [[Foraging|forageables]] and [[Slimes]] that will attack the player. Slimes here have a chance of dropping [[Mahogany Seed]]s when slain.

