'''Large Stumps''' are the remains of long-dead trees that are found on [[the Farm]], the [[Secret Woods]] and [[the Mines]]. A [[Axes|Copper Axe]] (or better quality) is required to remove a large stump, yielding 2 [[Hardwood]] and 25 [[Foraging]] Experience points. Players with the [[Skills#Foraging|Forester]] profession have a 50% chance of receiving one extra piece of hardwood. Stumps also have a 10% chance of dropping [[Mahogany Seed]]s.

